  abilityId: 1860108
  abilityName: Strict Admonishment
  abilityDesc: 19 combo Dark attack on all foes (consecutive uses boosts damage),
    15 combo massive random Dark attack on all foes, adds probable random status
    ailment infliction and probable 1 turn Atk, Def, Rec reduction effects to Atk
    for 3 turns, hugely boosts Dark elemental damage for 3 turns & slighty boosts
    OD gauge
